From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rxodin <rxodin@localhost>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 13:01:10 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: codecs: wcd934x: unprepare the slim stream before
 disabling it

Taken from https://gitlab.com/jenneron/linux/-/tree/68360b73aaee537c359c13c457d3b5bb779f4f0d (sdm845-mainline based AYN Odin kernel, pmaports linux-ayn-odin).
---
 sound/soc/codecs/wcd934x.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/sound/soc/codecs/wcd934x.c b/sound/soc/codecs/wcd934x.c
index bc41a14..d375294 100644
--- a/sound/soc/codecs/wcd934x.c
+++ b/sound/soc/codecs/wcd934x.c
@@ -1891,8 +1891,8 @@ static int wcd934x_trigger(struct snd_pcm_substream *substream, int cmd,
 	case SNDRV_PCM_TRIGGER_STOP:
 	case SNDRV_PCM_TRIGGER_SUSPEND:
 	case SNDRV_PCM_TRIGGER_PAUSE_PUSH:
-		slim_stream_disable(dai_data->sruntime);
 		slim_stream_unprepare(dai_data->sruntime);
+		slim_stream_disable(dai_data->sruntime);
 		break;
 	default:
 		break;
